# Illustrative finite-mass support for estimated-splash.profile.
# NOT measured Zildjian stand geometry, mass, stiffness, drag or felt data.
# Coordinates share the shell's reference frame. Both backings translate in Z.
frankensim-felt-mount-v1
# mass_kg, ground_K_N/m, ground_R_Ns/m, initial_Z_m, initial_V_m/s
carrier,0.4,3200,8,0,0
# backing_Z_m, felt_thickness_m, prior_maximum_compression_strain
upper,0.0280,0.006,0.05
lower,0.0150,0.006,0.05
# reference_stress_Pa, reference_strain, loading_p, unloading_q, crush, densify
felt,30000,0.2,2.2,3,0.15,0.7
# WHOLE-WASHER series Kelvin stiffness/viscosity; apportioned by site area.
creep,4500,24
# x_m,y_m,loaded_projected_area_m2: 3-point declared area quadrature per face.
# Area totals the same illustrative OD30/ID13 mm annulus as the legacy example.
# No claim that three points resolve its continuous contact-pressure field.
site,0.012,0,0.00019137535248117825
site,-0.006,0.010392304845413264,0.00019137535248117825
site,-0.006,-0.010392304845413264,0.00019137535248117825
